  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "How many 1’s are there in the binary representation of the decimal numbers from 22 to 32, inclusive?",
        "zh": "把十进制数22到32(包含22和32)用二进制表示,共会出现多少个数字1?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "34",
            "zh": "34"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "35",
            "zh": "35"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "36",
            "zh": "36"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "37",
            "zh": "37"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "38",
            "zh": "38"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "| Decimal | Binary | Number of 1s |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 22 | `10110` | 3 |\n| 23 | `10111` | 4 |\n| 24 | `11000` | 2 |\n| 25 | `11001` | 3 |\n| 26 | `11010` | 3 |\n| 27 | `11011` | 4 |\n| 28 | `11100` | 3 |\n| 29 | `11101` | 4 |\n| 30 | `11110` | 4 |\n| 31 | `11111` | 5 |\n| 32 | `100000` | 1 |\n\nThe total number of 1s is **36**.\n\nThe endpoints are included, so count 11 numbers. Add the last column: $3+4+2+3+3+4+3+4+4+5+1=36$. Notice that 32 is `100000`, which contributes only one 1 after the carry from 31.\n\n**Answer: C.**",
        "zh": "| 十进制 | 二进制 | 1的个数 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 22 | `10110` | 3 |\n| 23 | `10111` | 4 |\n| 24 | `11000` | 2 |\n| 25 | `11001` | 3 |\n| 26 | `11010` | 3 |\n| 27 | `11011` | 4 |\n| 28 | `11100` | 3 |\n| 29 | `11101` | 4 |\n| 30 | `11110` | 4 |\n| 31 | `11111` | 5 |\n| 32 | `100000` | 1 |\n\n数字1共出现 **36** 次。\n\n区间包含两个端点，一共要统计 11 个数。把最后一列相加：$3+4+2+3+3+4+3+4+4+5+1=36$。注意 31 进位到 32 后变成 `100000`，只贡献一个 1。\n\n**答案：C。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
