    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Which number is the largest?\n\n$$\n101100000_{2}\\qquad 535_{8}\\qquad 15F_{16}\n$$",
        "zh": "下列哪个数最大?\n\n$$\n101100000_{2}\\qquad 535_{8}\\qquad 15F_{16}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$101100000_{2}$",
            "zh": "$101100000_{2}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$535_{8}$",
            "zh": "$535_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$15F_{16}$",
            "zh": "$15F_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "2 of them are the largest",
            "zh": "其中有2个数最大"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "all 3 are the same",
            "zh": "3个数一样大"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Converting each to binary makes $101100000_{2}$ the largest:\n\n$$\n101100000_{2}=101100000_{2}\n$$\n\n$$\n535_{8}\\qquad =101011101_{2}\n$$\n\n$$\n15F_{16}\\qquad =101011111_{2}\n$$\n\nAn independent decimal comparison gives $101100000_2=256+64+32=352$, $535_8=5\\times64+3\\times8+5=349$, and $15F_{16}=256+5\\times16+15=351$. Thus $352>351>349$. The number of written digits alone cannot compare numbers in different bases.\n\n**Answer: A.**",
        "zh": "将三个数转换成二进制：\n\n$$101100000_2=101100000_2,\\quad 535_8=101011101_2,\\quad 15F_{16}=101011111_2.$$\n\n比较可知，$101100000_2$ 最大。\n\n也可统一换成十进制：$101100000_2=256+64+32=352$，$535_8=5\\times64+3\\times8+5=349$，$15F_{16}=256+5\\times16+15=351$。所以 $352>351>349$。不同进制的数不能只比较写出来的位数。\n\n**答案：A。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find f(7) , given:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} 1 & \\text{if }x=1\\\\ x+f(x-1) & \\text{if }x>1 \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据以下定义，求 $f(7)$：\n\n$$f(x)=\\begin{cases}1 & x=1\\\\x+f(x-1) & x>1\\end{cases}$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "27",
            "zh": "27"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "28",
            "zh": "28"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "30",
            "zh": "30"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "36",
            "zh": "36"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "38",
            "zh": "38"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Evaluate each starting at 1:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(1)&=1\\\\ f(2)&=f(1)+2=3\\\\ f(3)&=f(2)+3=6\\\\ f(4)&=f(3)+4=10\\\\ f(5)&=f(4)+5=15\\\\ f(6)&=f(5)+6=21\\\\ f(7)&=f(6)+7=28\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote: the sequence generated is 1, 3, 6, 10, 15, 21, 28, ... These are called triangular numbers - each nth term is the sum of the first n integers. The formula for that sum is $\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$ . For n = 7 , it is $\\frac{7\\times8}{2}=28$ .\n\n**Answer: B.**",
        "zh": "从 $f(1)=1$ 开始逐项计算，得到 $1,3,6,10,15,21,28$。\n\n这是三角数数列，第 $n$ 项等于前 $n$ 个正整数之和：\n\n$$f(n)=1+2+\\cdots+n=\\frac{n(n+1)}2.$$\n\n所以 $f(7)=\\frac{7\\times8}{2}=28$。\n\n递推式每次在前一项上加当前参数：$f(2)=1+2=3$，$f(3)=3+3=6$，继续得到 $f(4)=10,f(5)=15,f(6)=21,f(7)=28$。基本情况是 $f(1)$，不是 $f(0)$。\n\n**答案：B。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          3
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Recursive Functions",
        "zh": "递归函数"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Find f(20) , given:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\begin{cases} f\\!\\left(\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)+1 & \\text{if }x\\text{ is even}\\\\ f(x+3)-1 & \\text{if }x\\text{ is odd and }x>3\\\\ \\dfrac{x+1}{2} & \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}\n$$",
        "zh": "根据以下定义，求 $f(20)$：\n\n$$f(x)=\\begin{cases}f\\!\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right)+1 & x\\text{ 为偶数}\\\\f(x+3)-1 & x\\text{ 为奇数且 }x>3\\\\\\frac{x+1}{2} & \\text{其他情况}\\end{cases}$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "3",
            "zh": "3"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Evaluate the function by working forwards, then backwards.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(20)&=f\\left(\\frac{20}{2}\\right)+1=f(10)+1=4+1=5\\\\ f(10)&=f\\left(\\frac{10}{2}\\right)+1=f(5)+1=3+1=4\\\\ f(5)&=f(5+3)-1=f(8)-1=4-1=3\\\\ f(8)&=f\\left(\\frac{8}{2}\\right)+1=f(4)+1=3+1=4\\\\ f(4)&=f\\left(\\frac{4}{2}\\right)+1=f(2)+1=2+1=3\\\\ f(2)&=f\\left(\\frac{2}{2}\\right)+1=f(1)+1=1+1=2\\\\ f(1)&=\\frac{1+1}{2}=\\frac{2}{2}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe argument chain is $20\\to10\\to5\\to8\\to4\\to2\\to1$. In particular, the odd argument 5 increases to 8; recursion need not decrease at every call. Only 1 uses the final branch, and the subtraction attached to $f(5)$ must be retained while unwinding.\n\n**Answer: D.**",
        "zh": "先展开递归，再从基本情况向上回代：\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} f(20)&=f\\left(\\frac{20}{2}\\right)+1=f(10)+1=4+1=5\\\\ f(10)&=f\\left(\\frac{10}{2}\\right)+1=f(5)+1=3+1=4\\\\ f(5)&=f(5+3)-1=f(8)-1=4-1=3\\\\ f(8)&=f\\left(\\frac{8}{2}\\right)+1=f(4)+1=3+1=4\\\\ f(4)&=f\\left(\\frac{4}{2}\\right)+1=f(2)+1=2+1=3\\\\ f(2)&=f\\left(\\frac{2}{2}\\right)+1=f(1)+1=1+1=2\\\\ f(1)&=\\frac{1+1}{2}=\\frac{2}{2}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n参数变化链为 $20\\to10\\to5\\to8\\to4\\to2\\to1$。其中奇数 5 会先增加到 8，不能把递归误认为每一步都必须变小。只有参数 1 进入最后的基本情况；回代到 $f(5)$ 时要保留该层的减 1。\n\n**答案：D。**"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          2,
          4
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
