    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "What Does This Program Do?",
        "zh": "程序分析"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "What is the output when this program is executed?\n\n```text\na = 24 : b = 2 : c = 3\nif a / c == b ^ c then\n    b = b * c\nend if\nif c + a / b > b then\n    a = a - b * c\nend if\nb = b + a / 3\nif b > a + c then\n    b = 2 * b\nelse\n    c = a / c\nend if\noutput a + b / c ^ 2.\n```",
        "zh": "执行以下程序,输出值是多少?\n\n```text\na = 24 : b = 2 : c = 3\nif a / c == b ^ c then\n    b = b * c\nend if\nif c + a / b > b then\n    a = a - b * c\nend if\nb = b + a / 3\nif b > a + c then\n    b = 2 * b\nelse\n    c = a / c\nend if\noutput a + b / c ^ 2.\n```"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "10",
            "zh": "10"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "22",
            "zh": "22"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "28",
            "zh": "28"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "49",
            "zh": "49"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Trace the variables in execution order:\n\n| a | b | c |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 24 | 2 | 3 |\n| 24 | 6 | 3 |\n| 6 | 6 | 3 |\n| 6 | 8 | 3 |\n| 6 | 8 | 2 |\n\nThe final expression is $6+8/2^2=6+2=8$.\n\nThe first test is $24/3=2^3=8$, so $b=6$. The next test is $3+24/6=7>6$, so $a=6$. After $b=6+6/3=8$, the last test is $8>6+3$, which is false: execute the `else` branch, giving $c=2$. Evaluate the exponent before division in the output.\n\n**Answer: A.**",
        "zh": "按程序执行顺序记录变量的值：\n\n| a | b | c |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 24 | 2 | 3 |\n| 24 | 6 | 3 |\n| 6 | 6 | 3 |\n| 6 | 8 | 3 |\n| 6 | 8 | 2 |\n\n最后的表达式为 $6+8/2^2=6+2=8$。\n\n第一次判断为 $24/3=2^3=8$，成立，故 $b=6$。第二次判断用更新后的 $b$：$3+24/6=7>6$，故 $a=6$。随后 $b=6+6/3=8$。最后判断 $8>6+3$ 不成立，执行 `else`，得到 $c=2$。输出时先计算平方，再除，最后相加。\n\n**答案：A。**"
      },
      "source": {
